E", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393272_528042999853730_2354717409969290768_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y1KAaDUf338Q7kNvwHRPyt-&_nc_oc=AdnIThzsPmgvQ3_KykFA2QXiR9XHjwdjyXj58jgLLmxIe4rOtGxS-EnYnfHva-b57Ok&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftWIRay4BZqrNIC_ye9Sq8jQPCQuyE5eSDc8gXTlmCdTQ&oe=69A433B6"}]}, "id": "1201716164854208", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "ScreenShot09.png", "id": "1847710892750149", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391959_1847710896083482_8455521519849642166_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4mXkdR9cjnEQ7kNvwHwMbx6&_nc_oc=Adn0SsAqlLjw1mMYO_CtIrZj5B6HBAGXeZWVIK6QCklokHYsC5rt1-243S_GWgZKaFw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuudcQ70WVWfbU4xqEsPzTe_fnG7uPZn6cJoZCqKSMTFA&oe=69A439B7"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot07.png", "id": "558446980581371", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393328_558446983914704_7041934379838428535_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7UH58X50K3QQ7kNvwFXLOMM&_nc_oc=Adkj5OX1fztobEyieIuvmTKI8jltQlfvltjw1dAzkTqHZbodmMvU4gBdqexfm3Tf2W4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuHkalKB6-_ZA1k2M7u1Jo029eUHIirQjzuViYdoK6CJw&oe=69A433CA"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot05.png", "id": "643700711594610", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393887_643700714927943_2314168505514143083_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OCKa3um52xUQ7kNvwH4mnPv&_nc_oc=AdmqknlUzMdHJp4ir7I6a9qvRsFy2jzXxbbdKwj1TL-wrv4X1Q62JsEQQGuw011hsh0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuNRFXGDbCO3qV6zMoJ1SkEoNyZdBSDbpQ_ElHzd3PjJQ&oe=69A42FE2"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot06.png", "id": "1284290416010883", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391982_1284290419344216_9045095641995815940_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_QheNi9tWLsQ7kNvwH1DOSI&_nc_oc=AdnAdp8VvEioxv8QdCyQis8qtlPRNEPr5vrK93poXNFy2MmrHSDjFbyi781d8EFG6h0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuM0T6RwmjhCxXQ7LTCfdvOK81g84_s5v6uO8gByRYj9A&oe=69A43D88"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot03.png", "id": "2057311598107878", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391911_2057311601441211_8310860660269077219_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Goz8XennBSgQ7kNvwEs7ErI&_nc_oc=AdlIig3_uCUv4q2nwLP-in5NYfqyoCG0HHRX_xvr96wsiRyxLzHsPXhf_o4uHJRV1wQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvSL5G1J1Eg-Zyvhdpt1YLw_aXaNAh3AqgjARf5cicPWg&oe=69A43CAA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Forefront_Youtube_Thumbnail_2560x1440_v2.png", "id": "1340037183858384", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393432_1340037187191717_4433184722322802065_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6z-jdGM2SNMQ7kNvwEubgZl&_nc_oc=AdnSJI9AUT7mDuF53W4iR4ZTyEIFkF1K7D9ejL0vFmxPNsyodNHq3OZBGDLyFnw5Xmc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftGKDlJQQz0hpaJn7vsbyBaRO5a1u2NIs1azvAkrhyY8A&oe=69A41C4C"}, "display_name": "Forefront", "keywords": ["Forefront", "fps", "shooter", "military", "action"], "long_description": "# Forefront \u2013 The Next Evolution of VR Warfare\nFrom the creators of **Breachers** and **Hyper Dash**, **Forefront** delivers an **all-out war experience like never before in VR**. Engage in **massive 32-player battles** across a variety of expansive, semi-destructible environments, where strategy, skill, and teamwork decide the outcome.\n\n{1815988855801809}\n\n\ud83d\ude81 **Command land, sea, and air vehicles** \u2013 Pilot helicopters, drive tanks, and storm objectives in humvees and boats.\n\n{659860923053266}\n\n\ud83d\udd2b **Choose your class** \u2013 Play as Assault, Engineer, Medic, or Sniper, each with specialized weapons and gadgets.\n\n{978836180978704}\n\n\ud83d\udd25 **Feel the impact** \u2013 Realistic gunplay, tactical movement, and large-scale combat bring the battlefield to life.\n\n{1416901679278740}\n\n\ud83d\udca5 **Shape the fight** \u2013 Blast through walls, collapse structures, and use destruction to create new paths or deny enemy cover.\n\n{988904792660435}\n\nThe year is **2035**. A powerful energy corporation, O.R.E., has built a private military to defend its **monopoly on Red Orpiment, a rare mineral set to power the world**, while local governments and resistance fighters battle to reclaim control. You are the tip of the spear in the war to control it\u2014**which side will you take?**\n\n\u26a1 **Early Access in 2025 \u2013 Playtests begin this summer!**\n\n\ud83d\udccc **Wishlist now to be the first to fight!**\n\n\ud83d\udd17 **Join our community: ForefrontVR.com/Discord**\n", "short_description": "Forefront is an intense VR shooter featuring 32-player large-scale battles, land, sea, and air vehicles, and immersive, tactical combat. You are the tip of the spear in the war between a global energy giant and resistance forces. Which side will you take?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.triangle-factory.be/forefront-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.triangle-factory.be/forefront-terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "Triangle Factory", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.triangle-factory.be/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracki